  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 47d71981a39ce93409e921c2aa3b200e, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - "Wah! Oh my, you really startled me! I\u2019ve never seen you here before!"
  - I sure would have recognized a creature that pink.
  - You're a pig? I only know those boars, they sometimes come through here but they
    don't really like talking...
  - "Whether I\u2019ve seen anything that explains how you got here? Nah, sorry I
    was busy working on the trees all night!"
  - Are those mushrooms? I never really tried those! Can you bring me some of those?
